| `input_adb_lookup(a.csv)`
```### Split multivalue fields ###```
| foreach mac [eval <<FIELD>>=split(<<FIELD>>, "|")]
```### Validate field values ###```
| eval mac=mvfilter(match(mac, "^([0-9a-f]{2}:){5}[0-9a-f]{2}$"))
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="a.csv", "a")
```### Fill null values ###```
| eval priority = if(isnull(priority), "3", priority)
```### Eval expression fields ###```
| eval label = upper(owner) . "-" . priority
```### Shallow merge assets with matching key fields (using basic stats) ###```
| eval _key = mac
| search _key=*
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, latest(_time) as _time, latest(priority) as priority, values(mac) as mac by _key
```### Deep merge assets with matching key fields (using custom command) ###```
| eval _key = mac
| adbmerge max_keys=25
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, latest(priority) as priority, values(mac) as mac by _key
```### Trim multivalue fields ###```
| eval mac = mvindex(mac,0,4)
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, priority, mac, label
| outputlookup assetdb
